What should these ownership assertions establish when run with the previous module’s model?

Environment: JUnit Jupiter test source using the Expense and canRead domain example from the previous module. For HTTP tests use the project’s configured Spring MVC test support; these assertions alone are not a full endpoint test.

```java
// JUnit Jupiter test fragment in the expense service project.
@org.junit.jupiter.api.Test
void ownerCannotBeChangedByRequest() {
  var expense = new Expense(1, "alice", 1250);
  org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertTrue(canRead("alice", expense));
  org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.assertFalse(canRead("bob", expense));
}
```
